// Stages.get_stage_id_ (Stages.asm ~1484): on the tournament layout Remix
// gives Dream Land (page 3), Yoshi's Island DL (pages 1-2) and Saffron City
// DL (page 3) a hazard mode by page instead of from the table. Compare
// against no stage (0xFF) instead, so the table decides for every stage.
